{
  "id": "birthday-party",
  "title": "生日聚會",
  "titleEn": "Birthday Party",
  "category": "社交人際",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/birthday-party.webp",
    "alt": "在布置著彩色氣球與彩帶的明亮客廳裡，一群小朋友開心地圍在桌前慶祝生日，壽星看著插著蠟燭的美味蛋糕準備許願，桌上放著包裝精美的禮物盒。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Today, Leo goes to Sam's home for a fun "
        },
        {
          "text": "birthday",
          "wordIds": [
            "birthday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "party",
          "wordIds": [
            "party"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "今天，Leo 到 Sam 家參加有趣的生日聚會。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "275d7a49b2e9bd700728e2641c35bf0debfa386d74a992a3527ef9cbec69bcdf",
        "sha256": "6b273868ddf8c38704017c2d89ad3a8da6acb289723b2d3e3ba81fe072aa2ff4"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "All the friends smile warmly and cheer, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Happy birthday!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "happy-birthday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "所有的朋友溫暖地微笑並歡呼：「生日快樂！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "1bad966d0fc7a472157f99195dd55fd49c4c1c8592789579522757942f96965c",
        "sha256": "0904f2eb1932f4e98b34dc98dd467a672f7c2879b2978891dd507a2a1ad8e76e"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo gives Sam a wrapped "
        },
        {
          "text": "gift",
          "wordIds": [
            "gift"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "This gift is for you.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "this-gift-is-for-you"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 遞給 Sam 一份包裝好的禮物並說：「這份禮物是給你的。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7b750d2dbb68433d469c582bcbe21480f8c6a0db56a16ee2543fba5f0f688218",
        "sha256": "29ae65f4e18fe9e03e27d8331753dcb37f7541220073918b78a2e9848cd34643"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They gather around the table and sing a happy birthday "
        },
        {
          "text": "song",
          "wordIds": [
            "song"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " together."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們圍在桌子旁，一起唱著歡樂的生日歌。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "6957fba7605f8c06789c92146ae9ebf102c815fc4f2c38486684de68123434a8",
        "sha256": "5fa549547be7e6edf3227f25cf1f1c09e00ee42ee3b647177cdfa5f538ee1b1d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom brings out a sweet "
        },
        {
          "text": "cake",
          "wordIds": [
            "cake"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with a glowing "
        },
        {
          "text": "candle",
          "wordIds": [
            "candle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on top."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽端出一個香甜的蛋糕，上面插著一根發光的蠟燭。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "0a7a7d6909a52e7021eb308048ef6ed655670044390c6958aa13a9047fb7d8a3",
        "sha256": "902a15d727b41d1e6d568c13812469fc204a4b49ac1a3305b4c98b40d2e62741"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Everyone shouts, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Make a wish!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "make-a-wish"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "” and Sam blows out the candle."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "大家喊著：「許個願吧！」Sam 接著吹熄了蠟燭。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "79521506fb9ebe11afdd57ebc31496bdaad89c169755e67438b95ed04f5179ac",
        "sha256": "8eaff32b871bf47912708fcfa2299006593df150f3a6c707a7ed7cc9b6763dd1"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sam smiles at his friends and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you for coming.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thank-you-for-coming"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Sam 對著朋友們微笑說：「謝謝你們來參加。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/birthday-party/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "eb865d262f1c6d499a2708326815af9f2dbb16c121ecd66fd5a77a0af6476ae9",
        "sha256": "87d18e523e8e9a5c28436e08099dd2f62da2b635cf45bf48a88dd6ab318fc959"
      }
    }
  ],
